":[],"files":[],"id":"obs_muonumcz_bda7c3379c89","importance":5,"narrative":"i want to implement this: [**jCodeMunch MCP** is an open-source Model Context Protocol (MCP) server designed to eliminate token waste during codebase exploration[1]. While traditional coding agents explore repositories by opening whole files and reading hundreds of irrelevant lines, jCodeMunch shifts the retrieval paradigm from **file-level reading to symbol-level extraction**[2][3].\n\n---\n\n### Co…","origin":{"capturedAt":"2026-09-30T22:12:08.229Z","channel":"tool","detail":"conversation"},"sessionId":"2026-09-30T21-28-51-919Z_01a0f438-65ce-7627-8269-57ec07cb2f78","subtitle":"i want to implement this: [**jCodeMunch MCP** is an open-source Model Context Protocol (MCP) server designed to elimina…","timestamp":"2026-09-30T22:12:08.229Z","title":"conversation","type":"other"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_muonxr9u_1130bb9aa95b":{"observation":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":[],"id":"obs_muonxr9u_1130bb9aa95b","importance":5,"narrative":"Based on the baseline audit (**78.0% KV cache hit ratio**, **1.7M+ characters** in tool output across 858 bash calls, and long session trajectories), here is the prioritized action plan to maximize your `pi` agent's token efficiency across all four operational layers:\n\n---\n\n### Phase 1: Infrastructure Alignment & KV Prefix Locking (Target: >90% Cache Hit)\n\n1. **Freeze Prompt Head Invariance**: En…","origin":{"capturedAt":"2026-09-30T22:14:34.547Z","channel":"user"},"sessionId":"2026-09-30T21-28-51-919Z_01a0f438-65ce-7627-8269-57ec07cb2f78","timestamp":"2026-09-30T22:14:34.547Z","title":"prompt_submit","type":"conversation"},"type":"compressed"},"obs_muonymj0_35aa6694dccf":{"observation":{"concepts":[],"confidence":0.3,"facts":[],"files":[],"id":"obs_muonymj0_35aa6694dccf","importance":5,"narrative":"{\"command\":\"cd /c/Users/Mateusz/Desktop/root_worksapce && python3 scripts/check_workspace_integrity.py 2>&1 | tail -5\"} | [{\"type\":\"te